ns-section.test.ts # NEW: turn surface rendering tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:203:└── service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts # NEW: derived-view UI tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:210:| `convex/archiveEntries.ts` | New | Append/read canonical entries, sequence assignment, idempotency guard, pagination | Convex schema | AC-1.x, AC-2.3, AC-3.x, AC-7.3 |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:211:| `convex/archiveTurns.ts` | New | Store rebuildable cached turns | Convex schema | AC-4.x, AC-7.1 |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:212:| `convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts` | New | Store/read structural derived views | Convex schema | AC-5.x, AC-7.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:213:| `ArchiveFinalizationService` | New | Map completed process objects to archive entries; exclude deltas/partials | PlatformStore | AC-1.x, AC-2.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:214:| `ArchiveReadService` | New | Read archive entries, enforce access via routes/services, enrich related context, degrade locally | PlatformStore, artifact/source services | AC-3.x, AC-6.x, AC-7.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:215:| `TurnDerivationService` | New | Deterministically derive/rebuild turns from archive entries | PlatformStore | AC-4.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:216:| `DerivedArchiveViewService` | New | Build/read non-summarizing structural views | PlatformStore, TurnDerivationService | AC-5.x, AC-7.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:217:| `ProcessHistoryCompatService` | New | Bridge archive entries to existing history surfaces without migration | ArchiveReadService | A7, Story 0 |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-view