rn ids and source archive entry ids; it must not include generated\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:331:does not affect canonical archive entries.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:333:The array fields in `archiveTurns` and `derivedArchiveViews` are intentionally\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:334:bounded. Epic 7 limits turn rows to one process turn and derived views to small\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:336:at the archive-entry and turn level rather than trying to persist one giant\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:341:Shared contracts live in `apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts`.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:344:export type ArchiveEntryKind =\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:353:export interface ArchiveEntry {\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:354:  archiveEntryId: string;\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:357:  entryKind: ArchiveEntryKind;\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:373:export interface ArchivePage {\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:374:  entries: ArchiveEntry[];\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:382:  archiveEntryIds: string[];\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:389:export interface DerivedArchiveView {\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:395:  sourceArchiveEntryIds: string[];\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:408:| Get process archive | GET | `/api/projects/:projectId/processes/:processId/archive` | `ArchiveReadService.getArchive` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/te