ive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:53:- **TC-4.1a: Turns derived from archive**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:54:  - Given: A process has archive entries that form one or more interaction turns\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:56:  - Then: The platform returns turns derived from archive entries\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:57:- **TC-4.1b: Empty archive produces empty turn view**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:58:  - Given: A process has no archive entries\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:62:**AC-4.2:** Each derived turn references the archive entries it groups.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:64:- **TC-4.2a: Turn includes archive entry references**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:65:  - Given: A turn is derived from archive entries\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:67:  - Then: The turn includes references to the archive entries used to derive it\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:69:**AC-4.3:** Turn derivation does not mutate canonical archive entries.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:71:- **TC-4.3a: Archive unchanged after turn derivation**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:72:  - Given: A process has archive entries\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:74:  - Then: The canonical archive entries remain unchanged\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/04-turn-derivation.md:89:Story 4 introduces th