nd-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:27:- Archive visibility during derived-view failures\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:28:- Archive pagination default and maximum limits\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:36:- New archive entry taxonomy\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:44:- Story 6 archive provenance coherence\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:45:- All archive, turn, and derived-view route/services\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:52:**AC-7.1:** Archive, turn, and derived-view reads are restorable after reload.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:54:- **TC-7.1a: Archive and turn reads restore after reload**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:55:  - Given: A process has archive entries and derived turns\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:57:  - Then: Archive entries and derived turns remain readable\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:58:- **TC-7.1b: Derived view restores after reload**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:59:  - Given: A derived view exists for a process\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:61:  - Then: The derived view remains readable or can be rebuilt from turns\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:63:**