chiveEntries`; environment state is not required |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:101:| Turns | Read cached `archiveTurns` or rebuild from durable `archiveEntries` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:102:| Derived views | Read `derivedArchiveViews` or rebuild from turns when possible |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:108:| Archive route validation and pagination | `apps/platform/server/routes/archive.ts`, `apps/platform/server/schemas/archive.ts` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:109:| Archive/turn/view services | `apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-read.service.ts`, `apps/platform/server/services/archive/turn-derivation.service.ts`, `apps/platform/server/services/archive/derived-archive-view.service.ts` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:110:| Client bounded-page rendering | `apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-section.ts`, `apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-turns-section.ts`, `apps/platform/client/features/processes/derived-archive-views-section.ts` |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:114:- Archive entries are canonical and remain visible even when derived-view read or refresh fails.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:115:- Turn and derived-view projections are rebuildable from archive entries and turns.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/07-reopen-and-degraded-archive-state.md:116:- Derived-view refresh returns `settled`, `accepted`, or `degraded`; unsafe refresh conflicts return `ARCHIVE_DERIVATION_CONFLICT`.\