ies/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:71:  - When: User opens the process archive\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:72:  - Then: The archived entries remain available\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:74:**AC-3.3:** Archive reads enforce project and process access boundaries.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:76:- **TC-3.3a: Unauthorized archive read blocked**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:78:  - When: User requests a process archive from that project\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:79:  - Then: The platform rejects the request and does not leak archive content\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:80:- **TC-3.3b: Missing process archive read returns not found**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:82:  - When: User requests the process archive\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:85:**AC-3.4:** One degraded archive entry does not hide healthy archive entries on the read surface.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:88:  - Given: One archive entry is returned in a degraded state and other entries are healthy\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:89:  - When: User reads the archive\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:94:This story owns the first browser-facing canonical archive read surface.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-v