ocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:650:      - \"convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:653:      - \"tests/fixtures/archive.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:654:      - \"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:657:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Verified Story 0 foundation against the published story, full Epic 7 tech design, and test plan; then inspected the touched shared contracts, server schemas, Convex archive schema skeletons, PlatformStore seams, fixtures, compatibility mapper, coverage docs, and supporting tests, plus ran the story and epic verification gates.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:664:        title: \"Convex archive skeletons do not preserve the tech design's typed cross-table references\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:665:        evidence: \"Story 0 Definition of Done requires the Convex archive schema skeletons to align with the tech design (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/00-foundation.md:198-205). The design specifies relatedArtifactVersionId as v.id('artifactVersions') and archiveEntryIds/sourceArchiveEntryIds as v.id('archiveEntries') references (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:236-257, 276-287, 305-318). The implementation instead stores all three as plain strings in convex/archiveEntries.ts:28-44, convex/archiveTurns.ts:4-14, and convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts:9-22, so the foundational archive tables no longer enforce the designed artifact/archive referential contract.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:667:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:668:          - \"convex/archiveTurns.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:669:          - \"convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:678:        title: \"Convex archive skeletons do not preserve the tech design's typed cross-table references\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:679:        evidence: \"Story 0 Definition of Done requires the Convex archive schema skeletons to align with the tech design (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/00-foundation.md:198-205). The design specifies relatedArtifactVersionId as v.id('artifactVersions') and archiveEntryIds/sourceArchiveEntryIds as v.id('archiveEntries') references (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:236-257, 276-287, 305-318). The implementation instead stores all three as plain strings in convex/archiveEntries.ts:28-44, convex/archiveTurns.ts:4-14, and convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts:9-22, so the foundational archive tables no longer enforce the designed artifact/archive referential contract.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:681:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:682:          - \"convex/archiveTurns.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:683:          - \"convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:693:        - \"S0-DOD-5-archive-fixtures\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:707:      - \"Convex archive storage currently accepts arbitrary strings for relatedArtifactVersionId, archiveEntryIds, and sourceArchiveEntryIds instead of typed table ids, so production writes are not constrained to real artifact/archive records.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:713:      - \"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts passed and provides direct evidence for the Story 0 non-TC contract coverage.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:714:      - \"corepack pnpm run verify-all failed outside the touched Story 0 archive surface: packages/lbuild-impl integration suites could not resolve zod from packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/result-contracts.ts and packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/runtime-identity.ts.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:715:      - \"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder runtime branch was found in the touched archive foundation code; the blocker is schema-contract drift.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:723:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/006-verify.json\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:732:path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/001-quick-fix.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:745:      {\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"I’m going to inspect the Convex schema/contracts surface first, starting with the required Convex guidelines file and then locating the archive schema skeletons and story-gate tests that cover them.\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:750:    rawProviderOutputLogPath: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/streams/001-quick-fix.stdout.log\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:758:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/001-quick-fix.json\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:768:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/001-current.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:783:    path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:787:    path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-deri